  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1727\">\n<p data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1463\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1461\">Positive IgM Staining:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1727\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1621\">\n<p data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1621\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Supports presence of <strong data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1519\">IgM-secreting plasma cells</strong> (e.g., <strong data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1617\">Waldenstr&ouml;m&rsquo;s Macroglobulinemia, Lymphoplasmacytic Lymphoma, or reactive plasmacytosis</strong>).</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1727\">\n<p data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1727\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Must be interpreted along with <strong data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1726\">clinical findings, serum electrophoresis, and bone marrow studies</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1810\">\n<p data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1759\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1757\">Negative IgM Staining:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1810\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1810\">\n<p data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1810\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">No significant IgM-producing cells identified.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
